{
["key"] = "q:98389:accept:244808",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.0\nbuild=1.60.1/70790\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=98389\nevent=accept\nnpc=244808 Aramis Hammerhand\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=A Light in the Darkness\ntext<<\nGreetings, $c. Yes, I am a paladin. Not even death can stop the Light.\n\nThis is something my kind have in common with all Forsaken--we have overcome what the living view as their end. However, some even among our own fear us; they suspect we will smite them as some monstrosity.\n\nIn truth, our relationship with undeath is complex, but I am not here to hurt our own. Help me show the others this. Venture to Night's Web Hollow to the northwest and free the freshly raised fools trapped by the spiders there.\n>>\nsum=1951211922\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:3096:progress:2122",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.0\nbuild=1.60.1/70790\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=3096\nevent=progress\nnpc=2122 David Trias\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=1580\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Encrypted Scroll\ntext<<\nSo you've made it? Good, we'll have need of more rogues as time goes on. The Shadowstalkers will probably wind up finding you when they think the time's right, so don't go and slip up or do anything you might regret. They need talented agents... not pickpockets and fools.\n>>\nsum=517459001\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:3902:progress:1740",
