},
{
["key"] = "q:6701:progress:6766",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=6701\nevent=progress\nnpc=6766 Ravenholdt Guard\nkind=creature\nmodel=1011653\ndisplays=6573,6574\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Syndicate Emblems\ntext<<\nWe have been entrenched in a battle with the Syndicate for years. What they lack in skill they make up for in numbers. It's impossible to kill them off fast enough to have any noticeable impact on their population!\n\nWe've found that the best way to deal with their size is to pilfer their emblems. Once an emblem is stolen the shamed member is 'dealt' with internally.\n\nPick their pockets clean and turn the emblems in to me or one of the other guards.\n\nStart at Durnholde, south of here.\n>>\nsum=452978433\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:546:progress:2418",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=546\nevent=progress\nnpc=2418 Deathguard Samsa\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=1646\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Souvenirs of Death\ntext<<\nSo the lucky $N returns?  How many humans have you slaughtered today?  Hundreds I do hope!\n\nHave you any skulls for me?\n>>\nsum=1575332885\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:513:progress:2055",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=513\nevent=progress\nnpc=2055 Master Apothecary Faranell\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=1680\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Elixir of Agony\ntext<<\nCan you not see I am busy, $c?  The Dark Lady insists on a new plague before the Scourge advance from Northrend overwhelms us.  And with the human threat pressing from the south, time becomes my most precious commodity.  This better be important!\n>>\nsum=1177881136\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:515:accept:2055",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=515\nevent=accept\nnpc=2055 Master Apothecary Faranell\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Elixir of Agony\ntext<<\nA mudsnout composite?  Absolutely brilliant!  Why didn't I think of that?\n\nLet me contribute my colloid of decay to this devilish brew.\n\nIn order to activate the contaminating agents in this mudsnout mixture, Lydon is going to need a strong troll's blood elixir, as well as some daggerspine scales and torn fin eyes from the southern coast of Hillsbrad.  He'll know what to do once you've gathered him all the reagents.  And my, how anxious I am to hear how his experiment goes!\n>>\nsum=1760655762\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:98094:progress:270438",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=98094\nevent=progress\nnpc=270438 Deathstalker Masoj\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=146378\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Scout Support\ntext<<\nTiming is everything...\n>>\nsum=2040235107\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:529:progress:2215",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=529\nevent=progress\nnpc=2215 High Executor Darthalia\nkind=creature\nmodel=997378\ndisplays=1645\nsex=3\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Battle of Hillsbrad\ntext<<\nWere you able to carry out your orders, $c?  Did you dispose of Verringtan and his assistants?  And where is that iron shipment?\n>>\nsum=2020359470\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:515:progress:2216",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=515\nevent=progress\nnpc=2216 Apothecary Lydon\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=1660\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Elixir of Agony\ntext<<\nSo glad to see you back, $N.  I was growing so terribly bored here.  Not a single entertaining thing to do besides poison and disease Umpi and reanimate her. . .over and over and over again.\n\nHow went the trip to the Undercity?  Were you fortunate enough to slaughter any humans along the way?\n>>\nsum=541197882\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:532:progress:2215",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=532\nevent=progress\nnpc=2215 High Executor Darthalia\nkind=creature\nmodel=997378\ndisplays=1645\nsex=3\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Battle of Hillsbrad\ntext<<\nWhat news have you?\n>>\nsum=1989944829\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:547:progress:2419",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=547\nevent=progress\nnpc=2419 Deathguard Humbert\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=1647\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Humbert's Sword\ntext<<\nWere you able to retrieve my sword, $N?  High Executor Darthalia will hang me from the rafters if she discovers my folly.\n>>\nsum=265401696\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:517:progress:2216",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.4\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.5.0\nquest=517\nevent=progress\nnpc=2216 Apothecary Lydon\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=1660\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Elixir of Agony\ntext<<\nSometimes I get so bored out here in Tarren Mill I like to open up the formaldehyde jar and let the lovely aroma waft through the air.  Makes Umpi a little nervous though.\n\nSo were you able to get a keg from the Dwarves?  I swear if I have to stare at this deadly elixir without using it on someone for another day I am going to scream.\n>>\nsum=171370668\n",
},
{
