{
["key"] = "q:545:accept:2410",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.5\nbuild=1.60.1/70862\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.6.0\nquest=545\nevent=accept\nnpc=2410 Magus Wordeen Voidglare\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Dalaran Patrols\ntext<<\nBefore it mysteriously vanished, there was an enormous magical barrier around the newly-reconstructed city of Dalaran. I care not what caused such a magical marvel to fail, but I do care that the newly exposed outskirts of their city may hide valuable magical treasures. Vestiges of the ruins on which the new city is built. \n\nBut the area is patrolled by the wizards and their elemental slaves.\n\nSo hunt them, and return when their numbers are sufficiently reduced.\n>>\nsum=241379308\n",
},
