},
{
["key"] = "q:5421:progress:11317",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.6\nbuild=1.60.1/70888\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.6.0\nquest=5421\nevent=progress\nnpc=11317 Jinar'Zillen\nkind=creature\nmodel=1022938\ndisplays=11468\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Fish in a Bucket\ntext<<\nI'll reward anyone who makes my life a bit easier... I enjoy doing as little as possible, mon!\n\nBelow the docks here in Shadowprey Village, I've many shellfish traps.  If you're kind enough to do my work and collect me my shellfish, then I'll reward you with something you want... get my drift mon?  For every five shellfish you bring me I will give you a fine Bloodbelly fish!\n>>\nsum=728491753\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:1435:progress:4498",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.6\nbuild=1.60.1/70888\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.6.0\nquest=1435\nevent=progress\nnpc=4498 Maurin Bonesplitter\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=4171\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=The Burning of Spirits\ntext<<\nI have tried to make the magics as simple as possible. Drawing the spirit of your victim out of its injured form should be child's play. Do not rely on the gem's power to slay your foe completely. You must only activate the gem when they are close to death, or it will be useless.\n>>\nsum=759286853\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:1480:progress:4498",
