{
["key"] = "q:1481:progress:4498",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.6\nbuild=1.60.1/70888\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.6.0\nquest=1481\nevent=progress\nnpc=4498 Maurin Bonesplitter\nkind=creature\nmodel=959310\ndisplays=4171\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=The Corrupter\ntext<<\nDo not bring me an incorrect scalp, $c. Using the incorrect reagents could cause our deaths. The demon lord may have contingency spells on his person to slay those who would scry upon him.\n\nFate has already dealt me enough pain.\n>>\nsum=1243672288\n",
},
{
["key"] = "q:97265:complete:268705",
["envelope"] = "!SPOKEN1 quests\naddon=SpokenQuests/3.8.6\nbuild=1.60.1/70888\nlocale=enUS\npack=enUS\npackVersion=2.6.0\nquest=97265\nevent=complete\nnpc=268705 Aka'rai\nkind=creature\nmodel=1022938\ndisplays=145567\nsex=2\ncreature=Humanoid\ntitle=Hate the Hatefury\ntext<<\nI wish I had been able to watch your battles unfold and hear their wretched screams as they fell to your might.\n\nBut one of them surely eluded your slaughter. The one whose hand I shook in a ritual of spilled blood. So long as he roams the Desolace, I cannot risk stepping foot outside of Shadowprey. He would soon find me again, and with my soulstone in his possession... not even death would be an escape.\n\nEventually, I will have it back. But for now, your work is done.\n>>\nsum=75909171\n",
},
